                <body>
                    <h3>Menteve EEG Monitor v0.0.4 — Variant Refinements & UI Overhaul</h3>

                    <p><strong>UI Overhaul:</strong></p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Redesigned live monitor toolbar with responsive breakpoints and high-DPI support</li>
                        <li>Redesigned recordings viewer to match live-analysis visual language</li>
                        <li>Custom timeline slider and sharpened assets across all screens</li>
                    </ul>

                    <p><strong>Annotations:</strong></p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Editable annotations in both live acquisition and EDF viewer</li>
                        <li>Predefined event vocabulary; custom labels reused within a session</li>
                        <li>XDF annotation duration now persists on save</li>
                    </ul>

                    <p><strong>Clinical &amp; Research Variants:</strong></p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Separate channel configurations and impedance maps per variant</li>
                        <li>Separate predefined annotation event lists per variant</li>
                        <li>Fixed clinical channel mapping (T5/T6, A2/A1, T3/T4)</li>
                    </ul>

                    <p><strong>Bug Fixes:</strong></p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>APP_VARIANT now set correctly at runtime in packaged clinical builds</li>
                        <li>Bundled missing image assets in both Clinical and Research installers</li>
                        <li>Improved connection, streaming, and recording reliability</li>
                    </ul>
                </body>
